{
  "name": "anime-vault",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20.9.0"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "next dev",
    "build": "next build",
    "start": "next start",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
    "lint": "eslint .",
    "lint:tokens": "node scripts/lint-tokens.mjs",
    "format": "prettier --write .",
    "format:check": "prettier --check .",
    "test": "vitest run",
    "test:watch": "vitest",
    "test:cov": "vitest run --coverage",
    "test:e2e": "playwright test",
    "db:generate": "drizzle-kit generate",
    "db:migrate": "tsx scripts/migrate.ts",
    "db:push": "drizzle-kit push",
    "db:studio": "drizzle-kit studio",
    "seed": "tsx scripts/seed.ts",
    "enrich": "tsx scripts/enrich.ts",
    "verificar": "npm run typecheck && npm run lint && npm run lint:tokens && npm run test && npm run build"
  },
  "comentarioOverrides": [
    "Parches de seguridad sobre dependencias TRANSITIVAS, para no saltar a Next 16",
    "(el stack fija Next 15). postcss: XSS y lectura arbitraria via sourceMappingURL.",
    "sharp: CVEs de libvips heredadas (entra como optionalDependency de next).",
    "esbuild: el servidor de desarrollo acepta peticiones de cualquier origen; llega",
    "por drizzle-kit, que es devDependency.",
    "Revisar en cada actualizacion de next: cuando las traiga parcheadas, esto sobra."
  ],
  "overrides": {
    "postcss": "^8.5.26",
    "sharp": "^0.35.3",
    "esbuild": "^0.28.2"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@auth/drizzle-adapter": "^1.11.3",
    "@hookform/resolvers": "^5.2.2",
    "@neondatabase/serverless": "^1.1.0",
    "@node-rs/argon2": "^2.1.0",
    "@types/ws": "^8.18.1",
    "clsx": "^2.1.1",
    "drizzle-orm": "^0.45.2",
    "next": "15.5.23",
    "next-auth": "5.0.0-beta.32",
    "react": "^19.2.0",
    "react-dom": "^19.2.0",
    "react-hook-form": "^7.86.0",
    "sharp": "^0.35.3",
    "tailwind-merge": "^3.4.0",
    "ws": "^8.21.3",
    "zod": "^4.4.3"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@tailwindcss/postcss": "^4.3.3",
    "@types/node": "^22.10.0",
    "@types/react": "^19.2.0",
    "@types/react-dom": "^19.2.0",
    "@typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin": "^8.20.0",
    "@typescript-eslint/parser": "^8.20.0",
    "@vitest/coverage-v8": "^4.1.11",
    "dotenv": "^17.2.3",
    "drizzle-kit": "^0.31.10",
    "eslint": "^9.18.0",
    "eslint-config-next": "15.5.23",
    "eslint-config-prettier": "^10.1.8",
    "prettier": "^3.4.2",
    "server-only": "^0.0.1",
    "tailwindcss": "^4.3.3",
    "tsx": "^4.23.12",
    "typescript": "^5.7.3",
    "vite": "^8.2.2",
    "vitest": "^4.1.11"
  }
}
